# tools/cp/hunt/r3/soak60.p9 -- lane H6-hunt3 (docs/cp-hunt.md round 3, item 2):
# a >= 60-minute in-world soak on ManualSave-86: 14 phases soak01..soak14 of
# 17 x ~16 s (sprint / walk / turn / strafe / look), then QUIT GAME from
# the pause menu (a clean exit after an hour).  The phases give summarize.py a
# median per phase (fps drift); [THRS] / the launcher census give memory,
# threads and fd headroom over time.
phase menu
shot menu
seek menu-load main down 6 LOAD GAME
key ret
expect loadlist 30 LOAD\s*GAME|Expand\s*groups|Coll\w*\s*groups|Progression
key 0
wait 2
listseek loadlist-focus down 8 509
phase loading
key ret
expect loaded 400 PRESS\b.{0,24}\bTO\s+CONTINUE
key spc
wait 6
phase world
expect inworld 60 RIPPERDOC|Jackie
shot world-start
phase soak01
repeat 17
down shift
hold w 6000
up shift
look 350 0 15 16
hold w 4000
look -300 0 10 16
hold a 1500
hold d 1500
look 0 -30 5 16
look 0 30 5 16
wait 2
end
shot soak01-end
phase soak02
repeat 17
down shift
hold w 6000
up shift
look 350 0 15 16
hold w 4000
look -300 0 10 16
hold a 1500
hold d 1500
look 0 -30 5 16
look 0 30 5 16
wait 2
end
shot soak02-end
